==================================================================================================
PART 5 -- SPATIAL Q=0 TANGENCY: k!=0 VERSUS k=0
==================================================================================================
  delta(dot Q)(k) = u_M + 8*delta_X*f1*k**2*v/a0**2
  u_M(k!=0) = -8*delta_X*f1*k**2*v/a0**2
  u_M(k=0) = 0
  [PASS] finite-k Q tangency fixes u_M exactly
  [PASS] k=0 and k!=0 are explicit: u_M vanishes only at k=0
